OL,3,GNEWSATourette charity gets funding
OL,4,Aboost
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Hull charity that supports people
OL,7,Fwith Tourette syndrome has been thrown
OL,8,Fa financial lifeline.
OL,10,FT.I.C Yorkshire lost its funding in
OL,11,FApril, but on Monday its bosses
OL,12,Fannounced they had secured grants from
OL,13,FThe National Lottery and BBC Children
OL,14,Fin Need.
OL,16,FThe grants should cover 90% of the
OL,17,Fcharity's core costs for three years,
OL,18,Fsaid bosses.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
