OL,3,GNEWSATourette charity gets funding
OL,4,Aboost
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief executive Kim Mitchell said the
OL,7,Ffilm I Swear, which premiered in the UK
OL,8,Fin September 2025 and stars the
OL,9,Fcharity's patron Robert Aramayo, had
OL,10,Fboosted awareness of the condition.
